---
layout: shell.njk
permalink: /recap/archive/
title: Town recap archive
description: Every saved Franconia town recap, newest first. Each edition is the snapshot from the day it was written.
---
<main id="main" class="in recap-page" data-pagefind-body>
  <p class="paper-kicker">Town of Franconia, New Hampshire</p>
  <h1 class="page-title">Recap archive</h1>
  <p class="lede">Every edition is kept. The newest is first. Open one to read what the posted documents said at the time.</p>
  {% if recapEditions.length %}
  <ul class="paper-editions">
    {% for edition in recapEditions %}
    <li>
      <a class="paper-edition-card" href="{{ ('/recap/' + edition.date + '/') | url }}">
        <strong>Edition {{ edition.edition }}</strong>
        <span class="paper-edition-date">{{ edition.displayDate }}</span>
        <span class="paper-edition-text">{{ edition.teaser or edition.sections[0].lead }}</span>
      </a>
    </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
  {% else %}
  <p class="note">No edition has been saved yet.</p>
  {% endif %}
  <p class="more"><a href="{{ '/recap/' | url }}">Latest edition</a></p>
</main>
